{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1529,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8921f8a44c6994d1cd5f8682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样保持…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96922a4963ab7c55ff48ea476c2888799d2bfd2c677d3e678ed2239db64f6d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38cb441b07c43f644f8ca1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d565f7d24c02d5ad867ca75b48238623a036e7dec0758f74ab52924324feffa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984680de2754ea8be6cb5cce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯—…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cd721714121b892191250e0f21c8950fe949f3eecb21153c0eea3eaaac43090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f422194d397408e37685d05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没到睡觉时间哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "493412ae0994e07a54406ed2711d13c7dca57c91a06816ec0a59b405baaf440a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d321a10d19a75ea513ca6683",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骗人的吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c28d9cd9cc7ad4defb253cc97822aa9099b8008e208fdb627d999c4f8bd4b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ace8172e4da0db393068fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行吗…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "743c6026ccfafc510e4793bcc87db79a59fdaee30746b0ed9b01bac8cb08062c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:930164baa8a8eaebbc771a0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像能拿到这个哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc13d7879f148f8bc9f9908f93ef5621f6ef3e50c6581f1f80ed98dd749775bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ad7a080eb91f054097713b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…我还没问题。\r\n能忍耐到什么程度才是关键。\r\n好了，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdaf1ec9b9adbdc1eb97af791f95e00960399025f83aa3c22cffc0b33055e9c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68dd63161caa4b2f3247aeab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（荣获年度最辛苦大奖，\r\n太不容易了部门的三星评价哦～…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46edb2199a120695168d385a15636416d3631c88eb7bfa1cae6fc66463c8179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033798483fd6b8b27ec8b132",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花坛里开着美丽的花。\r\n即使刮风也顽强地挺立着——\r\n…呵呵，总觉得从它们身上获得了力量呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2d1b669ba1a102923fdef0aebccccbf80fb7c14b98fef4588ed4fb7b8d5a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ea9191c71fa6d31ffb2b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（今天的运势，是大吉耶！\r\n那么训练什么的完全小菜一碟\r\n嘛♪多少我都能做哦～！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b851edfea0d783c04d2ae0764b0c4de5564b763438920693852712b3c7c504b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:853561e81bfcb3d7ebacfaa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标已经很明确了。\r\n剩下的就只有实践。\r\n那么，我们要从什么开始呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d13cd14ed01bb49ee7e1c855eeb73461aae9dee34dfe43981b6c0c86c3a4db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf218a27cb4a22f2dfcdb5b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（薰衣草盛开的阳台～…\r\n——等等，啊哈哈！不行，\r\n太无聊了反而戳中笑点了！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "087268761691d791344fcbdd16b93173f75818250757b6485ee327fe2b528811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9674a29dfaf060e619b33a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让美丽的大花绽放——\r\n来吧，今天也精进自我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "396c4e48e4eb905ff613f2b8e9054ddb08c87b17403ab86f674a3ff73b2c3d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569f59b454f12432b7851863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（哎…宿舍房间的灯，我关了\r\n没有来着…？我应该是最后\r\n一个出来的吧…我没关吗！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d20a9f01c19b53bce76f027cf6e85789751befbb2aa45f149473724c7c85ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c374f04a43d4a4401f945fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…像往常一样进行吧。\r\n正是因为一直仰望着太阳，\r\n花儿才会绽放的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a4ce3532ef80529796373421dc9384997a0a49adc2c626a69b507fa83d9c6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0054f69bb50a4988294338ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（什么啊，那边墙上的黑色污渍…\r\n是脏东西，还是什么东西的影子…到底是哪个啊？\r\n嗯～～～～？到底是哪个！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4dea4de03540cdff7a9d516bca2285d992d9d3bb70ec873544e4722983cd25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94968bf091985bbe6a8126c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那边的路，是谁弄脏的啊…\r\n啊真是的…对不起，\r\n我可以去清理一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb763825dd652ef187619d9875dad9fa6082782701398024599f572db4df2a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:824c7031291b39280c9a6712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（哈啊…今天的广播节目里\r\n也没有读我的邮件…\r\n工匠之路真是险峻啊～～…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e83f8f7e95bf05a9f3a7e0d4d165c8e55c57b6328b0bb70a8500aa53d354c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a73064769d51aa54641cba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…你认真的吗？不，\r\n这不管怎么说也太地狱了吧…\r\n这可是违反合规条例要出局的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d4e4f1dce5ab6e1a264f080874cdba7a946e9dee6bf73760b1ddcd98736fac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821512bf612f7cc82a09b117",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…那个啊，我才不想让人看到\r\n我萎靡不振、丢人现眼的样子呢。\r\n这点程度，你应该明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd6a8069820389455f7f717ca0c3e815dbcbf8a0336219fb36bcdfa6e08541c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd04f4f33c294170873e360a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是作为『明星』，\r\n尽情绽放的时刻——千娇百媚的光辉，\r\n就让你们见识一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725c7ca145e754f9627210846e3e30ae520c0f2a2681d95d2301cbace1cbe1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c67a9ddbf30b7b939e19a1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫丁香是忍耐严冬才会绽放的花。\r\n…我也是一样的。经历了多少忍耐\r\n就会绽放得多么鲜艳夺目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "059c713993347ce3ebb861afd89f713f4c48dce3a2a35a16f07bf09afcce6b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791249b4934c3427df60bf70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（好嘞，轮到我出场了！\r\n我不把我的号码堂堂正正地\r\n挂在那个大大的公告栏上才怪…！！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b452dd4ab057e537a4e78a8be1e9d1d40081fa4eb4af7aee63f341a5b755fd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a3f3106e630884d2cc9254",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有一丝不安。\r\n因为我是稳扎稳打、不断钻研，\r\n才走到这一步的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ebabe241e7291b46f27f4583d078081ab941fc912dce2ae7aac73063865bfc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57114078707352c124698f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有这么多人来看我\r\n…真的很高兴。绝不能\r\n让他们看到我丢人的样子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89967493334b6dd77dac3659d1e4be4a14457f7073d27603bfd1364d359af548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f8a607e19fe08daccdb074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（刚才，有人在叫我的名字\r\n对吧！？有对吧！？呜哇～！\r\n谢谢啦，我会努力的！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1babf817fbad40f00f7663f6b74caf59a9f8810b491a1680337fce24aec86597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a9060b311b7face1d34e118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺直腰板，那么——\r\n我就像往常一样，\r\n去努力训练了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0cf38782404ab826558d79d20761e1f78afaff2d4369071fd4693650dec084c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29bef2d9f4f85e72b2aa8faa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…好，身体感觉活动开了。\r\n接下来就交给我，\r\n请安心地看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b250ddab1863e5e46144c5fe62f48b06d05e6c6fa7041c941bdcaec8656d7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8700b978c7ab54ea47c2ee5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（没有呆毛翘起来吧？\r\n…有些在意。稍微确认一下吧）",
      "source_fingerprint": "008062b626f923aa0f2c752c2a8dd7636fcb00052f044c88f4639aab01207718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df8a04f8690f284d866c4ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到处都十分热闹呢…\r\n…我要不要回休息室，\r\n去喝杯茶呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f514c6dc8f474e593eeeae806f1ca1ccaf1f7ca3abb4cee9cd171f6b629a734f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc24e9c428e2affa6b787ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…感觉有点冷了啊。\r\n好像还有时间，\r\n我可以去活动一下身体吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd59700ddca5131296047f131d528aabc68693ae1faef89fa1d24c14d916c8a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b327f452ad9b729cea1ffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（不——行——了！使不上力气…！\r\n是拉伸过度了吗！？\r\n搞砸了啦～～…！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1648aeccbcef5ef850ac40b6c2267f47d68161bfc0f0105aa34217c162a870ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616f21a2dfe0c7c6ead37613",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要成为明星的心，\r\n能让我闪耀光芒…\r\n所以，现在——",
      "source_fingerprint": "acde9fdf0cf476a0773b33bde092beb5a940280859174692cdd8b6be9df95a1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9244a14fc2925d7293bffcf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种程度，我至今为止也\r\n跨越过许多次了…只要紧绷神经，\r\n总会有办法的…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e59ce659865f216f80ffb1c8ab868249f9a1d83bdbfa2d1f1358cdf4de9b034b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a13dec410d78e0fb2da37e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（那块木板的花纹，\r\n看起来怎么像一张脸…\r\n好、好恶心～～～…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3764e50db862352ba14f39c57297e8adcc9eb5f0b18a000461a756a9d534add0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4ead5190b0452b6cdb378f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ec917f68ca8864ddb2ad4eb800eccca968da99504ad48a5e78de236d94f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6127e0d5260f57d74621b5ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d76b325b4747a7619b0685a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d099825c0b3ac7ea4b30d0ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ec917f68ca8864ddb2ad4eb800eccca968da99504ad48a5e78de236d94f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e9aa5873dcfe46d1dfe4b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff6e97db36920114fb96b4fe1eed7960aa18d8a7e9368601aad2cc27ff0640b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b5b1687e661e478afe969ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a5e3193870da2e87e3bb9996fe33ef3931ffbe44e71842051823edd9acfdde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2afc59e5c8a0a601078afa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e85984e4f6677132c942a6c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f31e73b2e6f107534dfcf0d00be547e4b23393aedcbc7b0edce30a5d9139704",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:544efb924b7c2765520e9d33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你。这将会成为我今后的动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ce728bb3e805c2cc8396f8e5e08348088ef065c731d2329075446dbbac5452b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4249c2444c4e84b97a73bafb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪我，真是帮大忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "224c66e59b768416e25021025bfb8f8fcef703e493745f0e85f68447c0970fe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09d44329db82beced5be4c8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc5f629ad63fee67f1778719b8dd679d48e2591d34ab4a0c040327ff3237142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a20169438758684a64f9c1b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb63eb98744f710675ecdf0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "776a4ff7cc24f0b0a8dd0d57905bb0558eedbb89704b99852e649948b7ed4b86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2878c60fd0d690c5906d02b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪我，真是帮大忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "224c66e59b768416e25021025bfb8f8fcef703e493745f0e85f68447c0970fe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36bc2972dc0eef1adce9855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（刚才，有人在叫我的名字\r\n对吧！？有对吧！？呜哇～！\r\n谢谢啦，我会努力的！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1babf817fbad40f00f7663f6b74caf59a9f8810b491a1680337fce24aec86597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a284796c883abfdd9c046b6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（好嘞，轮到我出场了！\r\n我不把我的号码堂堂正正地\r\n挂在那个大大的公告栏上才怪…！！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b452dd4ab057e537a4e78a8be1e9d1d40081fa4eb4af7aee63f341a5b755fd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a455f70e75a15513388c9146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪我，真是帮大忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "224c66e59b768416e25021025bfb8f8fcef703e493745f0e85f68447c0970fe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df512a469d5a5f5ff00d4a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139a8c4c6e61eef29cce60d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离春花烂漫…还有一点点距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "369d40248b1e885501982a92d2b38d3fb6887babb49de97ddc04cea2d6b32e8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbaa76092c86ec26d73919c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我一定要将这里染成一片紫色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c16b10d0cc27704fb5fdff31cd103d85ac4f1725d469f63a48a91b3c8240b24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d9e3e479891588ee08f003",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…做好了凋零的觉悟才会绽放的，这才是花啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a3602b4e6577ce20fe1f850035fcbf08fae6dc7a4b78001229f47f849af832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601189230b953586dfe66bba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使凋零，也会再次绽放…！花是如此，我也是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41be5c7b79cedcd196cf3d768a6e2918e640acce7120ee34e28950fca17743f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af4eee573071394fa1431dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千娇百媚…争奇斗艳，呢（太棒啦！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "99db3176b1570fb13861e6df7fabd8767225da5f270812dac5ee706a5a0c9fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06e2115476720d5b1b3a69fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为明星，我是否尽情绽放了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6108594076766af934bee406dc29ae1d9d7504a00006ae04558134e8a21c77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827f72d77c832f15164053d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b424e65adac71850ce78a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千娇百媚，花如飞雪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f617fa8eccadb645564ad55ea989eaacf9145ba6cdee57c6fe42d38ad1be44c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c684ab673e94bbb1da6a5188",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在那颗星星太过耀眼…但是总有一天，我也一定…！\r\n会成为绚烂夺目，争奇斗艳的——明星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d29e66f26db9e205215314340db995368864e9d8844f8e7ecfc5f5951e58d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1544b6ee42d217ae2a064ec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上我也会如花般绽放的。请多支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "064fd080a341d4b794d9ef92c3ddd9df2515bac8e700636a1dd927d045ffb22c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f688f9c631ea13bd77b66bc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能站在这么大的舞台上，真是我的荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec0396470101e4793f9bc4b55b90dcc720197331a7d18594cd5c5b62b084818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1fa6e79d29a1a8e065b47ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，拿出毅力继续做吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a51bd1bddb226f8c1e60a4636099b7228b419c5a98b9473fd09e2ed9eff3ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1d628893e04e9969906e500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你到底是在开玩笑\r\n还是认真的，我真搞不懂呢。\r\n嘛…这是夸奖哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed686568c34196e76e69bcf7fc16da4140a76462601d72df26f680002df7ebc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d04005f4891c9e017483112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿得整齐得体，这就叫做『气质』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa020e4924ec5696841ee7a491841fa4de9e1b33a91f82239954dfab9474478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786392d1b150a576c2aeed81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下摆散开的样子很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9ffcff39d46c34ef2e465e027c6941ef51bbc6306ba333391de7f54d347dd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f702529e969f7a857da56a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢花朵的装饰。感觉心情都会变得明朗起来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7753f270db0fe87bd672890e68ad5706a318927d26eec351606ff6458c66f752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d50839ba54d750e12393a33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很讲究柔顺剂的选择哦。味道很好闻吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76120ace87f24067ee51315b7ffde82dbead7fd89de1c7fe367c5b8c940de97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f96ba12f83a784fae7f9312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我平时就有在穿，已经习惯穿高跟鞋了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5759cec8484afbe574352a2b29c6e03440e8b6a070ac01d83566d96e9167b0f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70bb5dcad5a0cd034c47912f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起花哨的颜色，我更喜欢沉稳的颜色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c14ef1b5dc2abb34d9b716fc0cb842c62d95693ce567291864cfe6a6ceef1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3c130da3eaceceb2ecd5c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5678f8103c098a9ab1d0880aff026b49c2b091d04989b44b2951242b05d12073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0ae6eb2280d9d13edf2a7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺寸看起来也没问题呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8be34bd5697ad2bed0e899afa151e1f77e59108453382db9872e61b5b2f440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1116f676112a4629fcdb2703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "折痕我都是用熨斗仔仔细细熨出来的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c914a00e836761ef35460a4c315af6a756f8b263fa5a080149f058fd361b654",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b029e95984a2bd7a32d0ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站姿还是挺拔一点比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5dfea67f4c3e9b9639eebd5d552a9ad89bf2b2b843f50a336890e0bf37413fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908c0304c538598c64f09693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿得整齐得体，这就叫做『气质』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa020e4924ec5696841ee7a491841fa4de9e1b33a91f82239954dfab9474478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4b24e16f4b486eb8d37d2ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下摆散开的样子很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9ffcff39d46c34ef2e465e027c6941ef51bbc6306ba333391de7f54d347dd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c94f2d53365e1c979b0ebcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢花朵的装饰。感觉心情都会变得明朗起来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7753f270db0fe87bd672890e68ad5706a318927d26eec351606ff6458c66f752",
